OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford suspects released on
OL,4,Abail, head of counter-terror police
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,9,FSunday are released on bail, says the
OL,10,Fhead of UK counter terrorism policing
OL,12,FAssistant Commissioner Laurence Taylor
OL,13,Fsays the investigation is not over, and
OL,14,Fpolice are considering numerous angles,
OL,15,Fincluding if proxies working on behalf
OL,16,Fof a foreign state could have been
OL,17,Finvolved
OL,19,FThe men - all UK nationals in their 20s
OL,20,Fwho live in London - were arrested
OL,21,Funder the Explosives Act and on
OL,22,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
