OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford suspects released on
OL,4,Abail, head of counter-terror police
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say they are "very aware of the
OL,8,Flevels of speculation about the
OL,9,Fmotivation behind this incident, and
OL,10,Fthe geopolitical questions that are
OL,11,Fbeing raised". The Iranian embassy in
OL,12,Fthe UK denies any involvement
OL,14,FMeanwhile, Home Secretary Shabana
OL,15,FMahmood says that the scene is safe and
OL,16,Fresidents will soon be allowed to
OL,17,Freturn home
