OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, a farmer who called 999 when
OL,8,Fshe saw "a large group of hooded and
OL,9,Fmasked men" said she "foiled" their
OL,10,Fplans. People living nearby say
OL,11,Fsecurity had been ramped up before the
OL,12,Farrests
